  "story": {
    "text": "The {GYPSY} calls Jane in last. By the fire she reads Jane’s {FACE}, not her palm, and seems to know her heart. Then the voice {CHANGES}: it is Mr. Rochester in {DISGUISE}! But when Jane tells him a Mr. Mason has come from the West Indies, he turns {ASHEN}. That night a {SCREAM} wakes the house: Mason has been {STABBED}.",
